<name>Mirror</name>
<ttl id="1002V_S0002_744BB_T0042" variety="T0042">
<name>Inner Rear View Mirror Assembly</name>
<para id="RM000001K4J005X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="761TS-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000001K4J005X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000001K4J005X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000027H00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Inner Rear View Mirror Assembly (Inner Mirror EC Mirror)</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply black vinyl tape to the ambient light sensor area of the inner rear view mirror assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B166160" width="2.775699831in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect the battery positive terminal to terminal 2 and the negative terminal to terminal 5 of the inner rear view mirror assembly connector.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the mirror surface changes when light is shone on the mirror surface of the inner rear view mirror assembly.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Light Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Mirror Surface Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Light not shining on mirror surface</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No change</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Light shining on mirror surface</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Mirror surface dims</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
